* ''No clock decides a wait'' (operator, 2026-11-06: //"No timeout, 'No global now'"// and //"Approve your lean, event-only first"//). Every wait ends on the product's own events; a liveness window bounds silence only where the page offers no terminal signal. Test and hook budgets count as clocks too, and a sweep retires them (`M6`).

